  "name": "Median household income",
  "metadata": {
    "description": "Median household income, viridis dark purple (low) through teal and green to yellow (high). Measured over all 83,828 tracts with a published value: 7 classes with breaks at $40k/$55k/$70k/$90k/$120k/$160k, which fall at the 8th/22nd/41st/64th/83rd/94th percentile of the national distribution. 4.92% have a coefficient of variation above 0.3 and render faded \u2014 the estimate is real but its margin of error swamps it.",
